// An `equations:` LHS written prefix over a dual-declared name resolves to
// the NoEq symbol too (`naryOpApp` with eqn=true still goes through
// `lookupArity`'s NoEq-first lookup, Theory/Text/Parser/Term.hs:62-72,88-105):
// the equation registers under NoEq `f`, the signature echo prints it
// `f(x, y) = x` sorted among the pair projections by the derived
// `Ord CtxtStRule`, and the now-reducible NoEq `f` flags the lemma.
//
// Compared slices: the wf report block AND the `theory … end` echo.

theory DualDeclaredEquations
begin

functions: f/2 [AC], f/2
equations: f(x, y) = x

lemma L1:
  "All #i. Test(f('a','b')) @ #i ==> F"

end
